{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_06_end","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_06","title":"安魂曲","storyCode":"GA-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"f49e2f79c4bc9d506fb5cd17d1a5a71e980f7e664d3da9c3f6a1549bcd1740f7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"楼上的塞茜莉亚高唱古老的萨卡兹歌谣，钟声轰然鸣响。被称为“教宗”的老人向萨科塔发问：这是你我的幸运，还是不幸？","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"钟楼的过道很狭窄，脚下的石阶又湿又滑。石头墙壁很粗糙，摸上去凉凉的......就像那片森林里的树。\n脚步声回荡在走廊里，前面会有什么？\n我是萨科塔和萨卡兹的孩子，他们说，我身上寄托着......\n我不知道，那是我没有听过的音节。\n但我记得罗塞菈姐姐的表情。\n她双眼低垂，带着一点笑容，两手交叠在一起，仿佛掌中有什么宝物。\n他们......大家，希望我做什么呢？到现在，我也没明白。\n但是，我已经明白了，最应该去做的事情，是自己想要做的事。\n萨科塔也好，萨卡兹也好。\n我是塞茜莉亚。\n只是塞茜莉亚。\n......\n再见，妈妈......你会看着我吗？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔，左前方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，咱们也打不出个结果，要不然算了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是完全不听人说话啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔，你不是最担心塞茜莉亚的安危吗？其实说不定塞茜莉亚在我手里会更安全哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我会相信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来不说假话的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你说的是真的，塞茜莉亚自己不愿意，那就不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有时候我真觉得，安多恩给我添了很多麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"不要分神，艾泽尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......费德里科前辈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有感觉到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空气在颤动。\n仿佛有某种东西正从虚无中析出。\n那是一股强大而纯净的力量，却不像是任何已知的源石技艺。\n某种古老的结构正被唤醒。\n某种遗忘的声音将要鸣响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔，行动变更，你去钟楼确认情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"这个反叛信使交给我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下，这是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇尔丽芙，关闭中厅，暂停一切会面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的前任，上一代教宗，很喜欢研究历史，这件事你听说过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪你，他实在太蹩脚了。他那些文章错漏百出，让人不敢恭维。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与其说是在研究历史，不如说他喜欢把历史当成材料，尽情发挥他的想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他喜欢写一些相当......浪漫主义的比喻。虽然放在历史论文里实在有滥情的嫌疑，但确实能给人留下印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说，“历史，就是无形的巨人在大地上谱写的无限多声部的乐章”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照他这个比喻，我们这位巨人音乐家，可能写到新的一小节了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n肺里的空气被竭尽全力挤压而出，又被深吸回肺中。\n我绊了一跤，挣扎着爬起来，又向前冲去。\n我能清晰感觉到，有什么东西正在酝酿。\n就在钟楼顶层，就在那扇门之后，就在塞茜莉亚所在的地方。\n推开门——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"那个瘦弱的女孩在唱歌。\n一首古老的萨卡兹歌谣。\n她唱得如此真挚，嗓音稚嫩，投入了全部的情感。\n我只能呆呆站在原地，竭尽全力屏住呼吸，生怕我杂乱的气息打扰了歌声的流动。\n在某个瞬间，我突然发现自己什么也听不到了。\n唯有钟声，仿佛跨越亘古而来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......钟声......从启示石塔传来......这怎么可能......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那口钟从来没有响过啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只在，只在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数千年前，初代圣徒还行走于地上的时代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“日间，萨科塔见天上乌黑，不见太阳。夜间，魔鬼的军兵追来，戕害众多萨科塔。萨科塔失去许多辉光。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“众圣徒说：跟随我。于是石塔矗立。众圣徒说：聆听我。于是钟声鸣响。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“钟声回荡在旷野，萨科塔便结成一心。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“这是启示，这是箴言。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“日间便有亮光，不再被遮挡。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“众圣徒说：建筑一座城市，乃是萨科塔的乐园。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“众圣徒说：这城该叫拉特兰。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"启示石塔是拉特兰最古老的建筑之一，不，如果按典籍所载，是先有启示石塔，再有拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而圣钟于此刻再度响起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们的小塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可，为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许那位无形的巨人音乐家想要写几个强音，看上了拉特兰的老钟，在配器时选中它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"枢机薇尔丽芙，此刻在这圣堂中的却是你我，不知是幸运，还是不幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗阁下，我们必须立刻查清圣钟鸣响的原因......不，不论是什么原因，给出这个原因、解释这个原因的......必须是教廷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正值诸国使节齐聚拉特兰，出席代表皆为见证者，这未尝不是个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，薇尔丽芙，晓谕诸使节，拉特兰的钟声数千年后再度响起，这是变革的预兆，我们必须联合，为将来做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那启示石塔......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待已经足够了，就开始工作吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先导，您......难道早就知道了？塞茜莉亚到底是什么人......她，她虽然是混血，但......难道还有什么隐藏的秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，怎么可能。她只是你我所知的塞茜莉亚而已，或许身世有一点特别，但并无玄奥隐秘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许只是，拉特兰本身都在渴求改变，塞茜莉亚......刚好遭遇了这个时刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，她真是那个能够弥平萨卡兹和萨科塔千年裂痕的人，以至于启示为她而降，圣钟为她而鸣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也有可能只是个误会，是个巧合，是个埋藏在历史中的黑色幽默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们都知道，真相从来不是最重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不管怎样，这给了我们机会。要我说，这未尝不是我们被眷顾的证明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教廷的精力现在应该都放在了使节区和启示石塔那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会为您铺就那条路。您只需向前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......安多恩，钟声响了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那钟声属于一个即将启程的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的语气很轻松，你决定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的决定从未改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算会付出一切？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算会付出一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这有意义吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意义啊......意义不会凭空存在。我们的一切选择，不过是构想它，塑造它，给它降临的机会而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"愿你终能平静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂亚，你刚才的那句话，有违我们的初衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人人皆为基石，我们所交叠夯筑的坦途，留给后来者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须立刻觐见教宗阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑泰尔瓦多莱阁下，教宗阁下正在祈祷，暂时不见任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您谅解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概又是市民们的恶作剧吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对！爆炸声是从使节区传来的，那里已经停止所有爆破活动的审批了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍卫队","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"铳......铳骑泰尔瓦多莱阁下，使节区受到袭击！城内还有多处发生火灾和爆炸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迷途者！听到圣钟长鸣，他们终于也坐不住了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍卫队","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然之前已有铳骑阁下拨驻使节区，但......袭击和爆炸开始之后，使节们情绪激化，强烈要求增派铳骑保护......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，偏偏是这个时候！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"枢机薇尔丽芙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"启示石塔的圣钟再度鸣响，这是属于拉特兰的至圣时刻，首届“万国峰会”与各国使节也同蒙恩典，我们都该为此喜悦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而异端残党却趁机作乱，企图扰乱会议，黯淡拉特兰的荣光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑泰尔瓦多莱阁下，奉教宗谕令，请您前往使节区，与诸铳骑一同保护各国使节，确保万国峰会如期开幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将与你同往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。我说，枢机......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定也感觉到了，从启示石塔蔓延出的那股力量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请慎言，铳骑泰尔瓦多莱阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是荣光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g7_laterano_ward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，这也是他干的好事吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，你还打算包庇他？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向你道歉，菲亚梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前天，我不该对你说那样的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你先放开我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你原谅我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实生你的气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但更让我生气的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许我是在气我自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一点，我希望你相信我，菲亚梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他真的想要危害拉特兰......我绝不会放过他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他究竟想要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许，他是想问一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个萨科塔不该问的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能说明白点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为我也不太确定。这个问题应该在他心里埋了很久了......他也没有说过。只是我的推测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但八年前的事，确实与这个问题有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。所以，莫斯提马，你也知道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能，我和蕾缪安不一样，菲亚梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安也许是因为理解他，而我嘛......我只是因为，他不值得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我说，他挺可怜的。而我还有更重要的事要忙。就这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我怎么觉得你比蕾缪安还让我生气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不一样，菲亚梅塔。我做了能做的一切。而你......我猜你宁愿是我，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，你还知道什么，都告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你不会想听？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总要听了才知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚·拉珀尔塔，我奉教宗谕令，前来保护你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因为钟响了吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钟响，和我有关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无可奉告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你即刻动身，随我前往大教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥，没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_279_excu","aliases":["费德里科"]}]}
